     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet be-vs-score</b></p><a name=\"be-vs-score\"> </a><a name=\"hcbe-vs-score\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Fully specified name</b></td><td><b>English (English, en)</b></td><td><b>French (Belgium) (fr)</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/763117005\">763117005</a></td><td>FINDRISC (Finnish Diabetes Risk Score) score</td><td>Finnish Diabetes Risk Score (observable entity)</td><td>Finnish Diabetes Risk Score</td><td>Finnish Diabetes Risk Score</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/446661009\">446661009</a></td><td>Visual analog scale score (observable entity)</td><td/><td/><td>(EVA) Echelle Visuelle Analogique</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/273531005\">273531005</a></td><td>Index of Independence in Activities of Daily Living</td><td/><td/><td>Grille d'évaluation de l'autonomie pour les activités basales de la vie quotidienne</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/447316007\">447316007</a></td><td>Mini-mental state examination score (observable entity)</td><td/><td/><td>Examen mental de Folstein</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/444297006\">444297006</a></td><td>Malnutrition universal screening tool score (observable entity)</td><td/><td/><td>Malnutrition Universal Screening</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/443133008\">443133008</a></td><td>Norton pressure sore risk score (observable entity)</td><td/><td/><td>évaluation du risque d'escarre</td></tr><tr><td><a href